This artifact provides Material3 bindings for Compose Syntax Highlight.
It does not bundle third-party source code; runtime dependencies (Jetpack
Compose Material3, KTreeSitter, tree-sitter grammars) are resolved via
their own coordinates and ship their own NOTICE/LICENSE files. Theme
attributions (Solarized, GitHub Primer, Atom One, Dracula) ride with the
compose-syntax-highlight-core artifact, which this module depends on.
